d=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega\">\\(\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的公平硬币Borel概率空间。相关谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6bfdcc738fbd87ec\" href=\"?note=6bfdcc738fbd87ec\" title=\"43-df-computable-cantor-map\">43-df-computable-cantor-map</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9213597915e34d11\" href=\"?note=9213597915e34d11\" title=\"43-df-schnorrpreserving\">43-df-schnorrpreserving</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\operatorname{ComputableCantorMap}(\\Phi)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\Phi^{-1}[B],\\mu(B))\\in\\mu)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{SchnorrPreserving}(\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\operatorname{ComputableCantorMap}(\\Phi)\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\Phi^{-1}[B],\\mu(B))\\in\\mu)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{SchnorrPreserving}(\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：Schnorr检验U_n的逆像统一有效开，保测性令逆像测度与原测度相同，故逆像仍是Schnorr检验。用逐位总预言机计算接口替换旧Computable(Φ)类型误用。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable-cantor-map","status":"resolved","id":"6bfdcc738fbd87ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-cantor-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrpreserving","status":"resolved","id":"9213597915e34d11","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrpreserving]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"b039951a7138aeff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrtest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega\\to2^\\omega$，$\\mu$、$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 采用 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率空间。相关谓词见 [[43-df-computable-cantor-map]]、[[43-df-schnorrpreserving]]、[[43-df-schnorrtest]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-cantor-map","status":"resolved","id":"6bfdcc738fbd87ec","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Phi:2^\\omega